<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#e00" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
<p class="ct" style="margin:0">Price estimate</p>
